{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. A shoe is located on the left side of the scene. Directly below the shoe is a stapler, and these two objects are aligned vertically. Furthermore, for every lighter present, which is positioned to the right of the shoe, there is a fork located directly below it, and the lighter and fork are aligned vertically.",
